sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Ali as Ali (web app)
  participant API as API
  participant RUN as Run engine (LangGraph)
  participant LLM as Model
  participant GM as Gmail plugin
  participant DB as Postgres
  Ali->>API: Send "@Inbox reply to Vicky"
  API->>DB: save the message
  API->>RUN: start a run (thread, bot)
  RUN->>LLM: instructions + history + tools
  LLM-->>RUN: tool call gmail.send_email(...)
  RUN->>RUN: policy: Ask before acting × send = ASK
  RUN->>DB: save approval request + checkpoint
  RUN-->>API: interrupt (run paused)
  API-->>Ali: live update: approval card (to, subject, body)
  Note over RUN,DB: The run is asleep and uses no compute.<br/>It survives restarts and deploys.
  Ali->>API: Approve (with an edited body)
  API->>DB: save the decision (who, when, final args hash)
  API->>RUN: Command(resume = approved + final args)
  RUN->>GM: send_email(final args, idempotency key)
  GM-->>RUN: sent, message id
  RUN->>DB: audit log + run step
  RUN->>LLM: tool result
  LLM-->>RUN: "Sent. I told Vicky we can't do Q3."
  RUN-->>Ali: live update: reply + Done card
